BanMido wrote:
>
> I got a BoH from sokoban. I have two blessed magic lamps. I am
> planning on wishing for SDSM and Scepter of Might for reflection and
> MR respectively. I thought of getting the scepter as it doubles as a
> descent weapon against cross-aligned monsters and provides hunger-less
> conflict.

On the other hand it's a mace and you're restricted in mace.  In
this case I view going for the Sceptre as a fun and odd variation not
something to be done for strategy.

The Sceptre is one of the nice Quest artifacts unlike the samurai one
that usually ends up in a chest in a stash.  If you're going to wish for
a Quest artifact I'd consider the Magic Mirror of Merlin.

> I am playing a Samurai who is at Expert level in twoweapon fighting
> and has Excalibur. Is what I am planning OK or is there a better
> combination for a duel wielding Samurai?

It's okay but Excalibur is plenty good enough to ascend with.  Dual
wield Excalibur and a silver saber or your original katan.  Alternate
wield your yumi and keep a lot of arrows in your quiver.  Keep a stack
other than your initial ya for use against any disenchanter you
encounter.  Weaponry like that makes a samurai a killing machine already.


